<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="640" class="st-wrapper st-wrapper-background st-module-wrapper-table" style="width: 640px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" valign="top" style="width: 100%; padding-right: 39px; padding-left: 41px;"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="100%" style="width: 100%;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left"> 
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="560" class="st-mso-full-width st-mobile-full-width" style="width: 560px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" width="560"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" style="padding: 0px; width: 100%;"> <p height="20" width="100%" style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; mso-table-lspace:0pt; mso-table-rspace:0pt; text-size-adjust:100%; width: 100%; height: 20px; max-height: 20px; margin: 0px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 20px"> &nbsp; </p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 30px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 32px; padding-bottom: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="text-align: center; margin: 0px;"><span style="color: #147bd1;">OSHC Policy Updates &amp; </span></p> <p style="text-align: center; margin: 0px;"><span style="color: #147bd1;">AHM Market Exclusive Discount Starting 01 November</span></p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">Dear <strong><span style="color: #147bd1;">Flywire</span></strong> Agent Partner,</p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><br />We are pleased to share <span style="color: #223341;"><strong>two key updates</strong></span>: support measures following the CBHS policy sales closure, and an exclusive AHM discount campaign to help grow your OSHC sales.</p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;"><br /><span style="color: #147bd1; font-size: 22px; line-height: 33px;"><strong>CBHS New Policy Sales Are Closed</strong></span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><br />As previously communicated, CBHS International has ceased sales of their OSHC and OVHC products. <strong>New policy sales are no longer supported in Flywire systems.</strong></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;"><br /><span style="color: #48b985; font-size: 20px; line-height: 30px;"><strong>Crucial Action Required: Unpaid Quotes</strong></span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li style="list-style-type: none;"> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li><strong>We are in the final days to address any outstanding payments.</strong> All payments for new policy quotes were required by October 31st, 2025.</li> 
<li><strong>From November 1st, any unpaid quotes will be invalid.</strong> Students will need to get a new quote from one of our other government-approved insurers for all new policies.</li> 
<li><strong>Please encourage your studen</strong>t<strong>s to finalize these payments now</strong> to avoid disruption.</li> 
</ul> </li> 
</ul> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;"><span style="color: #48b985; font-size: 20px; line-height: 30px;"><strong>Extended Policy Administration Support</strong></span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><br />To ensure a smooth transition, we've extended our support: <strong>Flywire will continue to support all agents and students with CBHS policy-related Administration services until at least October 31, 2026 </strong><strong>including:</strong></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li style="list-style-type: none;"> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li><strong>Policy Cancellations</strong></li> 
<li><strong>Refunds</strong></li> 
<li><strong>Reductions</strong></li> 
<li><strong>Deferrals</strong></li> 
<li style="color: #223341;"><span style="color: #223341;"><strong style="background-color: transparent;">Policy Extensions</strong></span></li> 
</ul> </li> 
</ul> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li style="list-style-type: none;"> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li style="list-style-type: none;"> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li>Existing policies can be <strong>extended until February 28, 2026</strong>.</li> 
<li>Beyond this date, any future extensions will require purchasing a new policy from another insurer.</li> 
<li>Rest assured, due to portability rules, students will not need to re-serve waiting periods when switching providers.</li> 
</ul> </li> 
</ul> </li> 
</ul> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;"><span style="color: #147bd1; font-size: 22px; line-height: 33px;"><strong>Exclusive AHM Discount Campaign</strong></span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><br />We are excited to announce an exclusive discount for all new AHM OSHC policy sales.&nbsp;</p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><br />From 1 November 2025 to 31 January 2026, AHM have exclusively offered Flywire agent partners a discounted rate for all new AHM OSHC policy sales. As a result, this is the only place that you can secure the lowest priced OSHC policy available in the market (subject to the chosen family type and tenure of the policy purchased).</p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong>See the AHM Campaign Terms &amp; Conditions below for details!</strong></span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><br />Please ensure your teams are aware of these changes and ready to leverage this exclusive discount campaign starting November 1st. If you have any questions, please contact your dedicated Flywire Relationship Manager or email us at <a style="color: #223341;" href="mailto:support@oshcaustralia.com"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>support@oshcaustralia.com</u></strong></span></a>.</p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><br />To our shared success!<br />The <span style="color: #147bd1;"><strong>Flywire</strong></span> team</p> </td> 
</tr> 
</tbody>
</table> </td> 
</tr> 
</tbody>
</table> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left"> 
