<tr> 
<td width="100%" bgcolor="#DCEAF6" valign="top" style="width: 100%; padding-right: 39px; padding-left: 41px;"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="100%" style="width: 100%;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left"> 
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="560" class="st-mso-full-width st-mobile-full-width" style="width: 560px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" width="560"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" style="padding: 0px; width: 100%;"> <p height="20" width="100%" style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; mso-table-lspace:0pt; mso-table-rspace:0pt; text-size-adjust:100%; width: 100%; height: 20px; max-height: 20px; margin: 0px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 20px"> &nbsp; </p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 30px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 32px; padding-bottom: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="text-align: center; margin: 0px;">*AHM Campaign Terms &amp; Conditions</p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">Please find below the Terms &amp; Conditions for the upcoming AHM OSHC campaign:</p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li>Applies to new members who purchase an AHM Singles OSHC policy between 1 Nov 2025 – 31 Jan 2026.</li> 
<li>Couples and families are excluded.</li> 
<li>Existing AHM and Medibank OSHC members who renew during this period are also eligible.</li> 
<li>Policies must be purchased via the Flywire Agent Platform (inc. referral links) or the OSHC Australia website.</li> 
<li>OSHC extensions or deferrals to policies that were purchased prior to the 1st of November are excluded.</li> 
<li>Policies purchased within the campaign period, and have an extension or deferral within the campaign period will receive the discount.</li> 
<li>Any policy changes post the completion of the campaign period will result in the entire policy being re-priced at the non-discounted rate.</li> 
<li>This offer is not available via other sales channels, including ahmoshc.com.au or the OSHC Access portal.</li> 
<li>Excludes Overseas Visitors Health Cover, non-AHM Overseas Students Health Cover, resident hospital and extras covers, Accident Cover, Ambulance Cover, and other selected covers.</li> 
<li>Customers are responsible for ensuring their health cover meets their Australian Student visa requirements.</li> 
<li>Take-up of this exclusive offer is deemed acceptance of these terms.</li> 
<li>Not available with any other offer, except the Overseas Extras only cross-sell offer.</li> 
<li>AHM reserves the right to amend these terms without notice.</li> 
</ul> </td> 
</tr> 
</tbody>
</table> </td> 
</tr> 
</tbody>
</table> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left"> 
